@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
participant SquadCoordinator as C
participant QuboBuilder as B
participant ISquadSolver as S
participant "Remote sidecar" as R
participant "Enemy tactics" as T
C -> B: Capture tactical instance and build QUBO
B --> C: Return matrix and assignment constraints
C -> S: Request a tactical plan asynchronously
S -> R: Submit the optimization problem
R --> S: Return assignment or failure
S -> S: Use greedy fallback when unavailable or infeasible
S --> C: Return actual solver and result metadata
C -> C: Reject stale member or target snapshots
C -> T: Apply valid target assignments
@enduml
